    "long_instructions": "# Modify: Add the Else\r\n\r\nYour Task: A painter paints one square at a time, and it can only restock when it's standing on a bucket. Right now, the program only handles the bucket. When the Painter isn't on a bucket, nothing happens. Add a path for when it isn't.\r\n\r\nDo This:\r\n\r\n1. Run the program and watch the Painter. Is it on a bucket? Which part of the code ran?\r\n2. Add an `else` branch that tells the Painter what to do when it isn't on a bucket. You decide what it does.\r\n3. Run your program again. What changed? Which part of the code ran this time?\r\n4. Use Validate to check your work.",
